# Boot dumps of every stored pulse train (RF_DIAG=1 prints these).  They contain
# the real codes of whatever remote is in NVS, so they stay on the machine that
# captured them - docs/README.md 2.2 explains how to regenerate one.
docs/signals-*.log
*.local.log

# Serial captures from debug sessions (cap-serial.py output) and temporary
# upload transcripts.
docs/cap-*.log
docs/upload-*.log
docs/wifi-*.log
docs/ssh-*.log
docs/build-*.log

# Standalone reference project used during NFC bring-up (superseded by the
# unified firmware's NFC TOOLS).  Its source is tracked on purpose: it is the
# compact, verified record of the old emulation path; its .pio/ build tree is
# already covered by the global rule above.
